9", "pmcid": "PMC11728576", "title": "Validity and Reliability of a Linear Position Transducer to Measure Barbell Velocity, Duration, and Displacement During the Bench Press."}, {"doi": "10.3390/jfmk11020197", "pmid": "42200903", "pmcid": "PMC13214824", "title": "Comparison of the MetricVBT App and the Vitruve Linear Position Transducer for Assessing Execution Velocity and ROM."}, {"doi": "10.3390/jfmk10020109", "pmid": "40566406", "pmcid": "PMC12015919", "title": "Reliability and Accuracy of Linear Position Transducers During the Bench Press and Back Squat: Implications for Velocity-Based Training."}, {"doi": "10.70252/nvpi2815", "pmid": "39574974", "pmcid": "PMC11581383", "title": "Validity, Reliability, and Sensitivity of a Commercially Available Velocity Measuring Device When Performing Selected Exercises."}], "records": 21, "unique_works": 21, "provider_failures": 1, "identity_conflicts": 0}, "created_at": "2026-11-16T14:01:45.498497+00:00"}

